      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "If $v=⟨1,0,-1,3⟩$ and $w=⟨2,1,1,-3⟩$, then $v\\cdot w=$",
      "worked_solution": "Summing up the products of corresponding components, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v\\cdot w & ={v}_{1}\\cdot {w}_{1}+{v}_{2}\\cdot {w}_{2}+{v}_{3}\\cdot {w}_{3}+{v}_{4}\\cdot {w}_{4} \\\\  & =1\\cdot 2+0\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot 1+3\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =2+0-1-9 \\\\  & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
